{% block extra %}
## `ab_compression_data` and `get_ab_compression`

`ab_compression_data` and `get_ab_compression` are the same method under two
names; the full parameter and column reference is on the
[A/B Vocabulary Compression](/docs/tools/get-ab-compression) page. Apply a plan
with [`compress_events`](/docs/data-processors/compress-events), and read how
much data the screens need with the **Data needed** view of
[A/B Transitions](/docs/widgets/ab-transitions) and
[A/B Steps](/docs/widgets/ab-steps).

